          "lines": [
            "          5    Ai Lungh’ Bamv Hei ’Syangloupui Bamv",
            "                                 8.7.12. Ref. 12.8.8.12",
            "          Doh hei F",
            "",
            "          1. Ai lungh’ bamv hei ’syangloupui bamv;",
            "             Lungh ryanraa duidai ruc khou.",
            "             Poubauhmei le, ’khavlou na ro,",
            "             ’khavlou na ro.",
            "",
            "               Jisu Nang guangcdic tangh’ nungc kiu ningtowlou o.",
            "               ’Dih tuang paapc taanvphy laamei guay,",
            "               Pou’ khwan chu ’khou ai bam ngammak.",
            "               Jisu Nang guangcdic guang’ nungc kiu ningtowlou o.",
            "",
            "          2. Gaypui ganv hei kating dui e;",
            "             Ai thay ngammak ’thiammei ta.",
            "             Zinghmei muangc rui gumliam bam khou ’khavlou na ro.",
            "",
            "          3. Kaganv gay khou ringhting mut ’ni;",
            "             Thay lo, ringhbamv Kaipouc ta,",
            "             Kaganv kaguay Nang khangrui na sinsw ni the.",
            "",
            "          4. ’Dih tuang lanv guay khangsuangc sihnic,",
            "             Nang ta alung rui machunh.",
            "             Syangloupui sauc pyrun tei nic runtou sihnic."
          ]
        }
      }
    },
